Package: tsShinyApp
Type: Package
Title: Generate Interactive Shiny Time-Series Explorers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alek", "Rutkowski", email = "alek.rutkowski@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates a self-contained Shiny application and an RDS data file
    from a data.table containing time-series data. The generated application
    provides server-side categorical filtering, optional cascading filters,
    interactive Plotly charts, time-window selection, index rebasing,
    resizable chart cards, and safeguards for displaying many time series.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    data.table
Suggests:
    bslib,
    htmltools,
    plotly,
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
